WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.207
Open the Experiment Library and select Wave Propagation.

2
00:00:02.207 --> 00:00:03.896
Choose Preconfigured and start a connected experiment.

3
00:00:03.896 --> 00:00:07.580
Select Run to calculate the configured transmission line.

4
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:12.546
Open the Oscilloscope to view four measured CW voltage channels.

5
00:00:12.546 --> 00:00:16.032
Open Plot Studio to inspect the current measured voltage curve.
